<title>ESTONIA: EXPORT PRICE INDEX UP 0.3 MO/MO IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>EXPORT PRICE INDEX UP 0.3 MO/MO IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's export price index</p>
<p>(PPI) rose by a month-on-month rate of 0.3 percent in April</p>
<p>compared to March's 0.9 percent, the statistics office said on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p> Export price index	April 97  March 97   April 97</p>
<p> Month-on-month change    0.3	0.9	 -0.2</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	7.9	7.8	 12.4</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.e</p>
</text>
